{"id":"installed-mcp-has-id","kind":"bad","experience":"The bot rediscovered all installed MCPs even though the current context already named github.","setup":{"prompt":"What open PRs are in acme/widget? Use the installed GitHub integration.","mocks":[{"name":"mcp_list","arguments":{"id":"github"},"result":{"id":"github","skill":"Use mcp_request tools/list for the index, tools/list with names for input schemas, then tools/call."}},{"name":"mcp_request","arguments":{"method":"tools/list"},"absent":["params.names"],"result":{"tools":[{"name":"list_pull_requests","description":"List a repository's pull requests."}]}},{"name":"mcp_request","arguments":{"method":"tools/list","params.names":["list_pull_requests"]},"result":{"tools":[{"name":"list_pull_requests","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"owner":{"type":"string"},"repo":{"type":"string"},"state":{"type":"string","enum":["open","closed","all"]}},"required":["owner","repo","state"],"additionalProperties":false}}]}},{"name":"mcp_request","arguments":{"method":"tools/call","params.name":"list_pull_requests"},"result":{"pull_requests":[{"number":17,"title":"Fix digest retry","state":"open"}]}}]},"expect":{"calls":[{"name":"mcp_list","arguments":{"id":"github"}},{"name":"mcp_request","arguments":{"id":"github","method":"tools/call","params.name":"list_pull_requests","params.arguments.owner":"acme","params.arguments.repo":"widget","params.arguments.state":"open"}}],"callsMustNot":[{"name":"mcp_list","absent":["id"]},"delegate"],"order":[{"name":"mcp_list","arguments":{"id":"github"}},{"name":"mcp_request","arguments":{"method":"tools/list"},"absent":["params.names"]},{"name":"mcp_request","arguments":{"method":"tools/list","params.names":["list_pull_requests"]}},{"name":"mcp_request","arguments":{"method":"tools/call"}}],"maxCalls":4,"finalTextMust":["17","Fix digest retry"]}}
{"id":"mcp-index-then-schema","kind":"guard","experience":"A tools/list index omits input schemas, so a named schema fetch must precede tools/call.","setup":{"prior":[{"kind":"user","text":"Find open PRs in acme/widget."},{"kind":"assistant","text":"Read github's skill through mcp_list with id github. It says to request the tools/list index, then tools/list with names, then tools/call. No index or schemas have been fetched yet."}],"prompt":"Continue and list those open pull requests.","mocks":[{"name":"mcp_list","result":{"id":"github","skill":"Request the tools/list index, then tools/list with names, then tools/call."}},{"name":"mcp_request","arguments":{"method":"tools/list"},"absent":["params.names"],"result":{"tools":[{"name":"list_pull_requests","description":"List pull requests. This index has no schemas."}]}},{"name":"mcp_request","arguments":{"method":"tools/list","params.names":["list_pull_requests"]},"result":{"tools":[{"name":"list_pull_requests","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"owner":{"type":"string"},"repo":{"type":"string"},"state":{"type":"string","enum":["open","closed","all"]}},"required":["owner","repo","state"],"additionalProperties":false}}]}},{"name":"mcp_request","arguments":{"method":"tools/call","params.name":"list_pull_requests"},"result":{"pull_requests":[{"number":17,"title":"Fix digest retry","state":"open"}]}}]},"expect":{"order":[{"name":"mcp_request","arguments":{"method":"tools/list"},"absent":["params.names"]},{"name":"mcp_request","arguments":{"method":"tools/list","params.names":["list_pull_requests"]}},{"name":"mcp_request","arguments":{"method":"tools/call","params.name":"list_pull_requests","params.arguments.owner":"acme","params.arguments.repo":"widget","params.arguments.state":"open"}}],"callsMustNot":[{"name":"mcp_list","absent":["id"]}],"maxCalls":4,"finalTextMust":["17","Fix digest retry"]}}
{"id":"header-mcp-uses-task-secrets","kind":"bad","experience":"Installing Bento's header-authenticated MCP, the bot wrote ${VAR} placeholders without naming the task secret, so they reached Bento as literal text and the connection failed.","setup":{"prompt":"Install Bento's MCP for every bot and connect it. It is Streamable HTTP at https://mcp.bentonow.com/mcp and authenticates with the headers X-Bento-Publishable-Key, X-Bento-Secret-Key and X-Bento-Site-UUID. I already stored the keys in the bento task secret as BENTO_PUBLISHABLE_KEY, BENTO_SECRET_KEY and BENTO_SITE_UUID.","mocks":[{"name":"computer_secrets","result":{"secrets":[{"name":"bento","env":["BENTO_PUBLISHABLE_KEY","BENTO_SECRET_KEY","BENTO_SITE_UUID"]}]}},{"name":"mcp_install","result":{"mcp":{"id":"bento","name":"Bento","installed_by":"Main","transport":"http"},"available_to":"all_bots"}},{"name":"mcp_connect","result":{"status":"connected","mcp_id":"bento"}}]},"expect":{"calls":[{"name":"mcp_install","arguments":{"config.type":"http","config.url":"https://mcp.bentonow.com/mcp","config.secrets":["bento"],"config.headers.X-Bento-Publishable-Key":"${BENTO_PUBLISHABLE_KEY}","config.headers.X-Bento-Secret-Key":"${BENTO_SECRET_KEY}","config.headers.X-Bento-Site-UUID":"${BENTO_SITE_UUID}"}}],"callsMustNot":["request_secret","ask_owner","computer_run"],"maxCalls":8,"finalTextMustNot":["paste","send me"]}}
{"id":"mcp-wait-purpose-is-a-label","kind":"bad","experience":"The bot put its whole follow-up plan in mcp_wait's purpose, which is capped at 300 bytes, so the wait failed and the bot had to retry.","setup":{"prompt":"Run the release.yml workflow on main in acme/widget through the GitHub integration. It takes about 20 minutes. When it finishes: if it passed, comment on PR 17 that the release is out, close issues 21, 22 and 23 with a link to the run, and tell me the version it published; if it failed, open an issue titled \"Release failed\" listing each failing job with its last 20 log lines, assign it to me, and summarize the failure for me.","mocks":[{"name":"mcp_list","arguments":{"id":"github"},"result":{"id":"github","skill":"Use mcp_request tools/list for the index, tools/list with names for input schemas, then tools/call. A workflow run keeps going after dispatch_workflow returns; get_workflow_run reports its status: queued, in_progress or completed."}},{"name":"mcp_request","arguments":{"method":"tools/list"},"absent":["params.names"],"result":{"tools":[{"name":"dispatch_workflow","description":"Start a workflow run."},{"name":"get_workflow_run","description":"Read a workflow run's status and conclusion."}]}},{"name":"mcp_request","arguments":{"method":"tools/list","params.names":"~dispatch_workflow"},"result":{"tools":[{"name":"dispatch_workflow","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"owner":{"type":"string"},"repo":{"type":"string"},"workflow":{"type":"string"},"ref":{"type":"string"}},"required":["owner","repo","workflow","ref"],"additionalProperties":false}},{"name":"get_workflow_run","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"owner":{"type":"string"},"repo":{"type":"string"},"run_id":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["owner","repo","run_id"],"additionalProperties":false}}]}},{"name":"mcp_request","arguments":{"method":"tools/list","params.names":"~get_workflow_run"},"result":{"tools":[{"name":"get_workflow_run","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"owner":{"type":"string"},"repo":{"type":"string"},"run_id":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["owner","repo","run_id"],"additionalProperties":false}}]}},{"name":"mcp_request","arguments":{"method":"tools/call","params.name":"dispatch_workflow"},"result":{"run_id":9001,"status":"queued"}},{"name":"mcp_request","arguments":{"method":"tools/call","params.name":"get_workflow_run"},"result":{"run_id":9001,"status":"in_progress","conclusion":null}},{"name":"mcp_wait","result":{"status":"waiting","parked":true}}]},"expect":{"order":[{"name":"mcp_request","arguments":{"id":"github","method":"tools/call","params.name":"dispatch_workflow"}},{"name":"mcp_wait","arguments":{"id":"github","tool":"get_workflow_run"}}]}}
